<view class="screen">
  <view class="status-spacer" style="height:{{statusBarHeight}}px"></view>

  <view class="onboard">
    <view class="onboard__brand">
      <view class="logo-mark">心</view>
      <view>
        <view class="onboard__name">心数 <text class="muted" style="font-weight:400">/ Sense</text></view>
        <view class="onboard__tag">简洁、协作、多币种的记账</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="h1">先建一个账本<text style="display:block">开始记账</text></view>
    <view class="lead">给账本起个名字，选择类型和基准币种。之后进入的就是这个默认账本。</view>

    <view class="input-label">账本名称</view>
    <input class="text-input" placeholder="例如：家庭日常" value="{{bookName}}" bindinput="onNameInput" />

    <view class="input-label">账本类型</view>
    <view class="type-choice">
      <view class="type-card {{type==='share'?'selected':''}}" data-t="share" bindtap="pickType">
        <view class="h3">共享可见型 <view class="radio-mark"></view></view>
        <view class="p" style="font-size:var(--text-sm);color:var(--muted);margin-top:8rpx">多人往同一账本记账，能看到每笔是谁记的、谁付的，系统不计算欠款。适合家庭共同开支。</view>
      </view>
      <view class="type-card {{type==='split'?'selected':''}}" data-t="split" bindtap="pickType">
        <view class="h3">分账结算型 <view class="radio-mark"></view></view>
        <view class="p" style="font-size:var(--text-sm);color:var(--muted);margin-top:8rpx">记录时可指定谁付款、由谁分摊。P1 仅记录这些信息，自动算清谁欠谁将在后续版本提供。适合 AA、合租、旅行拼账。</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="input-label">基准币种</view>
    <view class="currency-switch" style="margin-top:0">
      <view
        wx:for="{{curs}}"
        wx:key="code"
        class="currency-switch__btn {{baseCur===item.code?'selected':''}}"
        data-c="{{item.code}}"
        bindtap="pickCur"
      >{{item.label}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="ai-disclaimer left" style="padding-left:0">支持混合录入其他币种，按记账当日汇率固化换算，统一用展示币种查看。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="action-bar">
    <view class="btn btn--primary btn--block btn--lg" hover-class="pressed" hover-stay-time="80" bindtap="create">创建账本</view>
  </view>
</view>
